            "sid": "REV 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengibona esinye isithunywa siphuma empumalanga, siphethe uphawu lukaNkulunkulu ophilayo; samemeza ngelizwi elikhulu kuzo izithunywa ezine ezazinikwe amandla okona umhlaba lolwandle, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sisithi: Lingoni umhlaba lolwandle lezihlahla, size sibeke uphawu lukaNkulunkulu wethu emabunzini ezinceku zakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
