          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "esizweni sakoZebuluni baba zinkulungwane ezilitshumi lambili; esizweni sakoJosefa baba zinkulungwane ezilitshumi lambili; esizweni sakoBenjamini baba zinkulungwane ezilitshumi lambili.",
          "type": "text",
